        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Refined Luxury and Craftsmanship",
        "content": "<p>Beyond mere textiles, our rugs are living legacies of Portugal's artistic and sustainable soul. Handcrafted by skilled artisans, every Corvo rug harmonizes tradition with innovation.</p><p>Our dedication to eco-friendly practices ensures that each piece not only enriches your space with luxury but also champions the preservation of our planet.</p>",
